## Focused tests (after the merged source is frozen)

Run each as an exact named test, preserving the complete output and observed test count:

- Broker notice module: `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker local_capture_notice::tests:: -- --nocapture` (module batch; report actual count, including ignored tests). Core cases include `notice_ingress_refuses_unbound_issuer_revision_and_capture_without_admission_effects`, `duplicate_ingress_and_owner_ticks_are_idempotent_for_one_arrival`, `pending_notice_limit_accepts_512_and_refuses_513_without_effects`, `owner_tick_marks_notice_from_old_epoch_stale_without_admission_effects`, and `ingress_cannot_interleave_between_notice_drain_and_wave_admission`.
- Service nonce status (run each listed command separately):
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_cli::lifecycle::tests::service_status_nonce_recovers_unknown_appointment_after_lost_output_without_replay -- --exact --nocapture`
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_cli::lifecycle::tests::service_status_nonce_reads_completed_history_across_revisions_and_epochs -- --exact --nocapture`
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_cli::lifecycle::tests::service_status_rejects_corrupt_body_index_bindings_without_writes -- --exact --nocapture`
- Prepare preflight:
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_cli::lifecycle::tests::verifier_prepare_refuses_oversized_literal_inventory_before_opening_state -- --exact --nocapture`
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker execution_verifier::prepare_preflight_tests::prepare_rejects_nonzero_exit_before_runtime_or_capture_side_effects -- --exact --nocapture`
- Capture-root release:
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_capture::tests::contribution_root_release_requires_exact_committed_receipt_and_is_idempotent -- --exact --nocapture`
  - `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_capture::tests::contribution_root_release_refuses_missing_or_uncommitted_receipts -- --exact --nocapture`
- Native root refusal: `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker native_gates::tests::dispatching_and_unknown_jobs_stay_rooted_without_a_process_tree_proof -- --exact --nocapture`.
- Guard proof: `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker local_target::tests::artifact_retention_permit_requires_each_exact_guard_and_owner_epoch -- --exact --nocapture`.
- Broker route/help: `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker collaboration_cli::tests::bootstrap_routes_are_named_and_documented -- --exact --nocapture`.
- CLI integration tests: `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-cli --test help_snapshots help_surface_matches_snapshots -- --exact`; then `cargo test --locked -j4 -p aethyme-cli --test help_everywhere help_works_everywhere_without_side_effects -- --exact`. Update snapshots only if the merged help intentionally changed and an independent review confirms the exact diff; inspect and retain both update and no-update records.

If a test fails during compile, records zero tests, selects more than the one intended test, or fails a setup predicate, preserve it as non-credit and stop to diagnose. Do not rerun a frozen attempt merely to improve parser classification.

## Static checks and binaries

After focused tests pass, run strict scoped lint:
`cargo clippy --locked -j4 -p aethyme-broker -p aethyme-cli -p aethyme-engine --all-targets -- -D warnings`

Then build the exact CLI and engine binaries without installing them:
`cargo build --locked -j4 -p aethyme-cli --bin aethyme`
`cargo build --locked -j4 -p aethyme-engine --bin aethyme-engine-cli`

Record full logs/status, source hash before/after, binary path, size and SHA-256. Do not run another workspace-wide suite already owned by root.

